-## M cut | local synchronous only
-S09:772-801 overlays S03:22-28, bridge:23-44 and wire:26-53. Build only the nominated positive private fixture. Use the same request/lease identity established at enter/bind and the exact original error at record/race/caught/finish. Own per-invocation cell. Do not share a global current-request pointer. A contact with a duplicate/foreign cell poisons that observer. Never throw from an observer into the application. Transport/validation errors disable diagnostics. Use the UUID already produced by the single original crypto.randomUUID at bridge:33, capturing the existing result into a local before the same header set. No extra generation or header read. Missing key permits an independently verified early M-only fact but no QA join. The key is synthetic correlation DATA, confers no access and never appears in the result artifact.
